{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/capcutapp/status/2114062937094823955","id":"2114062937094823955","text":"We’re excited to announce our new CapCut plugin is coming soon to @ChatGPT at CapCutWorldLA.\n\nThe plugin brings CapCut's video editing and generation tools alongside ChatGPT. You can start with an idea in ChatGPT, bring it to life with the CapCut plugin right inside ChatGPT, then take your draft video to CapCut's web editor to refine, share and publish. \n\nBy bringing the CapCut product you already love and use in ChatGPT, we're making content creation more seamless and efficient.","raw_text":{"text":"We’re excited to announce our new CapCut plugin is coming soon to @ChatGPT at CapCutWorldLA.\n\nThe plugin brings CapCut's video editing and generation tools alongside ChatGPT. You can start with an idea in ChatGPT, bring it to life with the CapCut plugin right inside ChatGPT, then take your draft video to CapCut's web editor to refine, share and publish. \n\nBy bringing the CapCut product you already love and use in ChatGPT, we're making content creation more seamless and efficient.","display_text_range":[0,484],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[66,74],"original":"ChatGPT","id":"1714438092655149056"},{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2114061334539317248","display":"pic.x.com/coddOkJ3Vt","original":"https://t.co/coddOkJ3Vt","replacement":"https://x.com/capcutapp/status/2114062937094823955/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"capcutapp","url":"https://x.com/capcutapp","id":"1258303237695795201","followers":56598,"following":17,"likes":910,"media_count":529,"name":"CapCut","description":"Welcome to a world of creativity 🌎\nCapCut World, our first global creator event\nSingapore · LA · London","raw_description":{"text":"Welcome to a world of creativity 🌎\nCapCut World, our first global creator event\nSingapore · LA · London","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1258303237695795201/178784